The static HTML/CSS and four-fetch inventories also allowed browser scripts
that constructed new elements or injected CSSOM rules at runtime. A red-first
inactive `document.createElement("img")` in authored TypeScript and
`CSSStyleSheet.prototype.insertRule(...)` in emitted JavaScript passed the
