The guard covers the five authored and five emitted modules, not browser DOM
execution, arbitrary computed method names, or complete CSSOM dataflow.
CSP enforcement, the opener argv credential defect, and wider P8 criteria
remain separate.

The browser source inventory also previously allowed console access and OS
error reporting, which could expose private session data without a fetch or
